<title>EGYPT: Arab Cotton Ginning results at end-Q3 1996/7.</title>
<headline>Arab Cotton Ginning results at end-Q3 1996/7.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of financial year 1996/7, which started on July 1.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds)</p>
<p>Net sales			    12,523,000</p>
<p>Production costs		    7,003,000</p>
<p>Net profit before tax	     5,520,000</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
